ible}\\)</span> (compatibility alias defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}indestructible} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\operatorname{CCCMeasurabilityIndestructible}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\exists\\check\\kappa\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\check\\kappa,\\kappa,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash^{\\mathsf{meta}}_{\\mathsf V,\\mathbb P}\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\check\\kappa)\\urcorner\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}indestructible} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\operatorname{CCCMeasurabilityIndestructible}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\exists\\check\\kappa\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\check\\kappa,\\kappa,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash^{\\mathsf{meta}}_{\\mathsf V,\\mathbb P}\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\check\\kappa)\\urcorner\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}indestructible\\text{-}alias} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\operatorname{ShelahIndestructible}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CCCMeasurabilityIndestructible}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}indestructible\\text{-}alias} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\operatorname{ShelahIndestructible}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CCCMeasurabilityIndestructible}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The original label does not by itself specify a unique standard large-cardinal notion; this atom fixes the explicit c.c.c.-preservation convention displayed above.</li>\n<li>The order and top condition are explicit, and the c.c.c. predicate is called with its exact two-place signature.</li>\n<li>Forcing over the proper-class ground universe is deliberately marked metatheoretic; the set-model recursion from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"58-df-forcing-relation\">58-df-forcing-relation</a> is not applied to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V\">\\(\\mathsf V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measurable-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ccc","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ccc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-canonical-check-name","status":"resolved","id":"fb43b1e2c83c0e1a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 